    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners O'Brien Swaine are delighted to present 1 Riverchapel Glen to the market. This 3 bed detached bungalow, built in 2007, is ideally positioned in a quiet, well-maintained estate in the heart of Riverchapel Village. This lovely home is a short walk from all local amenities, including the Riverchapel complex, local primary school, shops, pub, and a walking path leading to the popular seaside village of Courtown where you will find Forest Walks, Beach, Harbour and much more. Gorey Town Centre and N11 motorway access is a short drive away. \n\nInside, the property features a spacious kitchen/dining area, perfect for family meals and entertaining, along with a separate sitting room enjoying dual aspect windows, bay window and open fire place. The master bedroom benefits from built in wardrobes and includes an ensuite bathroom. There are two further well-proportioned bedrooms, both with built in wardrobes and a family bathroom. This comfortable, well laid out home will appeal to many.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises of entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen, 3 bedrooms, master ensuite and family bathroom. \n\nOutside, there is a private back garden, ideal for relaxation or outdoor dining. A double driveway provides ample off-street parking, while additional features include oil-fired central heating, a garden shed, outdoor tap, and external power socket.\n\nThis property offers an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or anyone seeking a bungalow in a peaceful coastal home within walking distance of amenities and beaches.\n\nServices \nMains\n\nInclusions \nCurtains NOT included\nLiving room light fitting NOT included"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall Wood laminate floor, Hot press, attic access<br>Kitchen/Dining Room (15.81ft x 14.01ft) Tiled floor, fitted kitchen units, cooker and hob, fridge freezer, dishwasher, washing machine, door to back garden<br>Living Room (15.81ft x 15.03ft) Wood laminate floor, bay window, dual aspect, open fireplace<br>Master Bedroom (15.98ft x 11.48ft) Wood laminate floor, built in wardrobes<br>En-suite (5.64ft x 5.15ft) Tiled floor, electric shower, w.c, w.h.b<br>Bedroom 2 (10.47ft x 8.14ft) Wood laminate floor, built in wardrobe<br>Bedroom 3 (14.17ft x 9.32ft) Wood laminate floor, built in wardrobe<br>Bathroom (10.30ft x 6.53ft) Tiled floor, bath, w.c, w.h.b"
      },
